[00:01.31][Verse 1]
[00:01.56]When things are right, then you just know
[00:04.58]There is something in your eyes that brings me home
[00:08.34]'Cause when there's love, you don't let go
[00:12.61]So as long as you're with me, you're not alone, you'll never be
[00:16.62][Pre-Chorus]
[00:16.87]I wanna tell you what I feel and really mean it
[00:20.89]I wanna shout it from the rooftops to the sky
[00:24.90]'Cause if you ever need a friend, you know I'll be it
[00:29.17]From tonight until we see the end of time
[00:32.93][Chorus]
[00:33.43]I'll cross my heart and hope to die
[00:37.95]We're always and forever I'll be by your side
[00:41.62]When days are dark and stars don't align
[00:45.89]We're always and forever 'til the end
[00:49.66]The end of time
